OpenMTP native macOS application

The native source was imported on 2026-11-04 from the existing prototype at
/home/mav/Code/agent-worktrees/openmtp-swift-native/macos. That source directory
remains untouched. The application now replaces the Electron application.

OpenMTP was created by Ganesh Rathinavel. The repository retains its MIT license,
reproduced in the app's Resources/LICENSE. The app logo is by Shubhendu Mitra.

The prototype's protocol comments reference kalam, go-mtpx and go-mtpfs as
historical interoperability references. Their attributed source remains available
in Git history at aaditagrawal/openmtp commit
6eb3e7b79727c7cef09844c72c35908caedfaa24. No Go or libusb implementation is
bundled in the native app.

